{"1707550706838729191":{"a":"<p>@ArtByAlida I know many folks doing this as well. Names are not historically very static. I spent time in the 90s developing genealogy search for central European society and the core problem to solve is name matching. Spelling is fluid and names change at borders. Lazy immigration agents.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1707518339344482429\">https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1707518339344482429</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1707550706838729191</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1707550706838729191\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-09-29T00:19:47Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1707679094471631143":{"a":"<p>If only they had thought to give it a name! Would be easier to find. Oh wait, you expect us to read this article. Not with a headline like that. <a href=\"https://x.com/WISH_TV/status/1707042761046638749\">Tweet by @WISH_TV</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/WISH_TV/status/1707042761046638749\">https://x.com/WISH_TV/status/1707042761046638749</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1707679094471631143</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1707679094471631143\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-09-29T08:49:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1707679604234711251":{"a":"<p>These have always been my favorite races. I spent a lot of time in the pits on the dirt tracks in my teens hanging out with Foyt et al. That&#x27;s the real test of a good driver. Can you stay in the race when the path is nothing but mud? <a href=\"https://x.com/IMS/status/1707576628593762595\">Tweet by @IMS</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a hr